<title>CANADA: Great-West Lifeco to split shares 2-for-1.</title>
<headline>Great-West Lifeco to split shares 2-for-1.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG, Manitoba 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great-West Lifeco Inc said on Thursday its board approved a two-for-one stock split, subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>The company said it would hold a special common shareholders meeting on December 12 to vote on the move.</p>
<p>The proposed split, if approved, would increase the number of Great-West shares outstanding to 157.4 million from 78.7 million.</p>
<p>Great-West is part of the Power Financial Corp group of companies.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
